# Superpowers specs

For non-trivial features or cross-cutting changes, check `docs/superpowers/specs/` for an existing design before inventing architecture.

- Specs are dated `YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`
- Matching plans live in `docs/superpowers/plans/`
- If a spec exists, implement against it; if requirements diverge, note the delta in the PR

Skip for obvious one-line fixes, dependency bumps, and pure refactors with no design impact.
